  }
}]]></Value>
      <Value Culture="en-us"><![CDATA[{
  "markup": "<p>\"Mullak\" is a program that anables owners and tenants of joint real estate units create a Real Estate Owners Association. This association helps with property and facility management, promoting a sense of coexistence and preserving ownership rights.</p>",
